  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">여러 선생님들과 본청에서 센서 활용 가이드북을 제작했다.(우리 연구회 선생님들&#128518;&#128077;)</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6066d05f82979aa1769ddae2963aec091963f336\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6066d05f82979aa1769ddae2963aec091963f336\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"1649\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">중등 교육과정에서 센서가 필요하다 싶은 실험들만<br>잘 정리해서 모아두었으니, <br>많이들 찾아주시면 좋겠다.<br><br>다시 말씀드리지만,<br>혼자 만든 것이 아니다! 여러 선생님들과의 합작품이다!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/016c4d20e28677da9f0828fe0e2de6d3550de471\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/016c4d20e28677da9f0828fe0e2de6d3550de471\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"1645\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">나는 옴의 법칙 실험(전류, 전압 센서 활용)과 <br>마찰력 실험(힘센서 활용)에 대한 내용을 작성했다.</p><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1c8e2301de95be51cadb725f53eae93cac710e4b\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"1554\" style=\"width:49.84%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1c8e2301de95be51cadb725f53eae93cac710e4b\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ab03af8993fe46a1ab1ffc8b014b39f22aa2018a\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"1544\" style=\"width:50.16%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ab03af8993fe46a1ab1ffc8b014b39f22aa2018a\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url